  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 4342,
      "start_sec": 1.84,
      "end_sec": 17.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Okay. Are we ready? Now I hear nothing from your end. Are we ready to go?",
      "frame_id": 1000,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4343,
      "start_sec": 17.0,
      "end_sec": 23.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Shall I proceed with the first winner? Yeah. And getting a thumbs up.",
      "frame_id": 1002,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4344,
      "start_sec": 23.0,
      "end_sec": 29.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Okay. And let's start with the most technical idea then.",
      "frame_id": 1002,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4345,
      "start_sec": 29.0,
      "end_sec": 36.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And before I announce the winner, let me start by saying that it wasn't easy.",
      "frame_id": 1005,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4346,
      "start_sec": 36.0,
      "end_sec": 44.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I wish there were more categories and more prices because all of you guys did a great job.",
      "frame_id": 1007,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4347,
      "start_sec": 44.0,
      "end_sec": 48.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I'm honestly impressed with the overall level.",
      "frame_id": 1007,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4348,
      "start_sec": 48.0,
      "end_sec": 54.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I think the general level was way beyond my expectations.",
      "frame_id": 1007,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4349,
      "start_sec": 54.0,
      "end_sec": 60.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "You guys chose very interesting and sensitive topics.",
      "frame_id": 1008,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4350,
      "start_sec": 60.0,
      "end_sec": 67.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I'm impressed with how far you got in many of the ideas despite the very limited time that you had.",
      "frame_id": 1008,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4351,
      "start_sec": 67.0,
      "end_sec": 71.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So let me start by saying that it hasn't been easy to pick a single winner.",
      "frame_id": 1008,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4352,
      "start_sec": 71.0,
      "end_sec": 78.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And a big congratulations to all of you. You all are doing great and have a brilliant future ahead.",
      "frame_id": 1008,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4353,
      "start_sec": 78.0,
      "end_sec": 86.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Nevertheless, let me announce the winner of the technical category, which is...",
      "frame_id": 1008,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4354,
      "start_sec": 86.0,
      "end_sec": 93.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "You're ready to hear team number 10, Edubot. Congratulations.",
      "frame_id": 1009,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4355,
      "start_sec": 93.0,
      "end_sec": 101.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And I don't hear any noise or anything from your end, but we thought it was a brilliant, brilliant idea.",
      "frame_id": 1010,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4356,
      "start_sec": 101.0,
      "end_sec": 105.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "The efficient use of limited network capacity implemented in AI.",
      "frame_id": 1012,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4357,
      "start_sec": 105.0,
      "end_sec": 107.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "The concept of less is more.",
      "frame_id": 1013,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4358,
      "start_sec": 107.0,
      "end_sec": 114.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And many of these benefits that you could also get with the S-Computing right have been dynamic resource allocation",
      "frame_id": 1014,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4359,
      "start_sec": 114.0,
      "end_sec": 122.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "and predictive learning and search engine, which is also offering quizzes and all the benefits.",
      "frame_id": 1015,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4360,
      "start_sec": 122.0,
      "end_sec": 127.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So big congratulations. I see some hacks there on the stage and some price.",
      "frame_id": 1016,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4361,
      "start_sec": 127.0,
      "end_sec": 129.0,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So good job, guys.",
      "frame_id": 1018,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4362,
      "start_sec": 129.0,
      "end_sec": 163.26,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And I hear nothing from your end. So just give me a thumbs up when you will need to start with the next category.",
      "frame_id": 1018,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4363,
      "start_sec": 163.26,
      "end_sec": 165.26,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Give the guys a minute there.",
      "frame_id": 1026,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4364,
      "start_sec": 165.26,
      "end_sec": 202.46,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Hall of Fame. All right. I see a thumbs up there.",
      "frame_id": 1026,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4365,
      "start_sec": 202.46,
      "end_sec": 213.46,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Then I guess we're ready to introduce the winner for the second category, which is the business category.",
      "frame_id": 1032,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4366,
      "start_sec": 214.46,
      "end_sec": 218.46,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And you guys ready to hear this?",
      "frame_id": 1033,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4367,
      "start_sec": 218.46,
      "end_sec": 230.42,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "The winner team for the business category is team number eight, Sustained Connectivity. Congratulations.",
      "frame_id": 1034,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4368,
      "start_sec": 230.42,
      "end_sec": 238.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "It was an excellent idea as well.",
      "frame_id": 1036,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4369,
      "start_sec": 238.8,
      "end_sec": 244.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "As I said before, it's not only close to my heart, but I think the other members of the jury are also appreciated.",
      "frame_id": 1037,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4370,
      "start_sec": 245.8,
      "end_sec": 256.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "It is really great technology in many of these relevant areas where access to electricity from the grid may be not insistent or quite limited.",
      "frame_id": 1040,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4371,
      "start_sec": 256.8,
      "end_sec": 264.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So I feel you touch on one of the main pain points, which is the initial investment, but then the little maintenance,",
      "frame_id": 1042,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4372,
      "start_sec": 264.8,
      "end_sec": 270.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "the long lifespan, the cost-effective solution in the long run, and not producing greenhouse gas emissions.",
      "frame_id": 1045,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4373,
      "start_sec": 270.8,
      "end_sec": 276.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "It's really important for the environment and also for the health of the local community.",
      "frame_id": 1046,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4374,
      "start_sec": 276.8,
      "end_sec": 279.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So congrats to all of you.",
      "frame_id": 1047,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4375,
      "start_sec": 279.8,
      "end_sec": 280.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Nice job.",
      "frame_id": 1047,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4376,
      "start_sec": 280.8,
      "end_sec": 314.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Okay, guys, I hear nothing from your end.",
      "frame_id": 1047,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4377,
      "start_sec": 314.78,
      "end_sec": 317.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So I'm going to say goodbye from Stockholm.",
      "frame_id": 1053,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4378,
      "start_sec": 317.78,
      "end_sec": 320.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And once again, thanks for having us.",
      "frame_id": 1054,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4379,
      "start_sec": 320.78,
      "end_sec": 324.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I hope you found this hackathon interesting.",
      "frame_id": 1054,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4380,
      "start_sec": 324.78,
      "end_sec": 330.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And those who didn't have the chance to win still learned something and got something productive out of it.",
      "frame_id": 1055,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4381,
      "start_sec": 330.78,
      "end_sec": 331.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I did learn a lot myself.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4382,
      "start_sec": 331.78,
      "end_sec": 334.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "I enjoyed a lot the opportunity to be here.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4383,
      "start_sec": 334.78,
      "end_sec": 339.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "So thank you, Jesper, Anders, Stefan, Toby, and everyone else for the organization.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4384,
      "start_sec": 339.78,
      "end_sec": 341.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "It was a real pleasure to be here.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4385,
      "start_sec": 341.78,
      "end_sec": 344.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "And once again, I cannot hear you guys, but have a great evening.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4386,
      "start_sec": 344.78,
      "end_sec": 346.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Thank you so much.",
      "frame_id": 1056,
      "slide_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4387,
      "start_sec": 346.78,
      "end_sec": 347.78,
      "speaker": "Speaker ?",
      "text": "Bye-bye.",
      "frame_id": 1057,
